  "content": "<article class=\"gl-celebration gl-celebration-photo-ready\">\n<section class=\"gl-celebration-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"sweet-title\"><figure class=\"gl-celebration-hero-media\"><img src=\"/assets/RTG_0182.jpg\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1366\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Sweet Sixteen portrait in a blue gown\"></figure><div class=\"gl-celebration-hero-copy\"><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">GioLina · Sweet Sixteen</p><h1 id=\"sweet-title\">A celebration.<br>A signature all your own.</h1><p>Sweet Sixteen photography &amp; cinematography,<br>with a little more care behind the camera.</p><a class=\"gl-landing-button\" href=\"/contact-us-2/?occasion=sweet-sixteen\">Let’s plan your celebration</a></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-landing-wrap gl-celebration-intro\"><figure class=\"gl-celebration-intro-photo\"><img src=\"/assets/GLP_0292.jpg\" width=\"1365\" height=\"2048\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Sweet Sixteen portrait in a pink gown\"></figure><div><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">A boutique approach</p><h2>Big-night energy.<br>Beautifully considered.</h2><p>The production care we bring to weddings belongs here, too. We get to know the family, listen to what makes this celebration yours, and prepare so you can enjoy it.</p><p>From portraits before the party to the entrance, speeches and dance floor, we work attentively around you. The people and personality of the night stay at the center.</p><a class=\"gl-landing-text-link\" href=\"/contact-us-2/?occasion=sweet-sixteen\">Tell us what you have in mind →</a></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-celebration-work\"><div class=\"gl-landing-wrap\"><div class=\"gl-landing-section-heading\"><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">Keep the night</p><h2>Photography &amp; Cinematography</h2><nav class=\"gl-sweet-entry-points\" aria-label=\"Explore Sweet Sixteen coverage\"><a href=\"#sweet-films\">Cinematography <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a><a href=\"#sweet-photography\">Photography <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a></nav></div><div class=\"gl-celebration-work-grid\"><article id=\"sweet-photography\"><div class=\"gl-image-rotation gl-celebration-photo-rotation\" data-rotate-images aria-label=\"Sweet Sixteen photography\"><!-- User-supplied temporary portfolio imagery. Replace individual sources after approved archive curation. --><img class=\"is-current is-fallback\" src=\"/assets/RTG_0182.jpg\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1366\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Sweet Sixteen portrait in a blue gown\"><img data-src=\"/assets/GLP_0292.jpg\" width=\"1365\" height=\"2048\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Sweet Sixteen portrait in a pink gown\"></div><h3>People. Details. The whole room.</h3><p>Portraits with presence, candid photographs with character, and the details that made the celebration feel like you.</p></article><article><h3>Let the celebration move.</h3><p>The voices, music and movement of the evening, shaped into a personal film you can return to together.</p></article></div><div class=\"gl-celebration-showcase\" aria-label=\"Sweet Sixteen showcase films\" id=\"sweet-films\"><article><div class=\"gl-film-preview \"><img src=\"/assets/sweet-gianna-photo.webp\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Gianna — Sweet Sixteen portrait\" style=\"object-position:50% 35%\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"793523768\" data-film-title=\"Gianna\" aria-label=\"Play film — Gianna\"><span>Play film</span></button></div><h3>Gianna</h3></article><article><div class=\"gl-film-preview\" style=\"aspect-ratio:12/5\"><img src=\"/assets/sweet-gabby-photo.webp\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Gabby — Sweet Sixteen portrait\" style=\"object-position:50% 35%\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"723528961\" data-film-title=\"Gabby\" aria-label=\"Play film — Gabby\"><span>Play film</span></button></div><h3>Gabby</h3></article><article><div class=\"gl-film-preview\" style=\"aspect-ratio:12/5\"><img src=\"/assets/sweet-gina-marie-photo.webp\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Gina Marie — Sweet Sixteen portrait\" style=\"object-position:50% 35%\"><button type=\"button\" data-mediazilla-src=\"https://mediazilla.com/ttnbvY81xe\" data-film-aspect=\"12/5\" data-film-title=\"Gina Marie\" aria-label=\"Play film — Gina Marie\"><span>Play film</span></button></div><h3>Gina Marie</h3></article><article><div class=\"gl-film-preview\" style=\"aspect-ratio:16/9\"><img src=\"/assets/sweet-julia-photo.webp\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Julia — Sweet Sixteen portrait\" style=\"object-position:50% 35%\"><button type=\"button\" data-mediazilla-src=\"https://mediazilla.com/8baRrhNAed\" data-film-title=\"Julia\" aria-label=\"Play film — Julia\"><span>Play film</span></button></div><h3>Julia</h3></article><article><div class=\"gl-film-preview\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/641\"><img src=\"/assets/julianna-poster.webp\" width=\"1280\" height=\"641\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Julianna\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"385087191\" data-film-title=\"Julianna\" aria-label=\"Play film — Julianna\"><span>Play film</span></button></div><h3>Julianna</h3></article></div><a class=\"gl-landing-text-link\" href=\"/contact-us-2/?occasion=sweet-sixteen\">Ask about photography &amp; cinema →</a></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-landing-wrap gl-celebration-experience\"><div><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">Before, during &amp; after</p><h2>Prepared for the party.<br>Present for the moment.</h2></div><ol><li><h3>Plan it like a production</h3><p>We talk through the entrance, family, traditions, formalities, special dances and the moments she cares about most — so the day feels organized without feeling staged.</p></li><li><h3>Treat her like the star</h3><p>On the day, we give her the same attention, direction and cinematic treatment we bring to a bride — polished portraits, beautiful movement, detail shots and room for the personality of the night to come through.</p></li><li><h3>Turn the night into a film</h3><p>The final edit should feel bigger than a birthday recap. It should feel like a milestone film — stylish, emotional and worth watching years later.</p></li></ol></section>\n<section class=\"gl-celebration-faq\"><div class=\"gl-landing-wrap gl-celebration-faq-grid\"><div><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">A few things to know</p><h2>Your celebration,<br>your questions.</h2><figure class=\"gl-sweet-faq-photo\"><img src=\"/assets/GLP_0292.jpg\" width=\"1365\" height=\"2048\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Sweet Sixteen portrait in a pink gown\"></figure></div><div><details><summary>Can we discuss photography and cinematography together?</summary><p>Yes. Tell us what you’d like to keep from the celebration, and we can discuss photography, cinematography or both.</p></details><details><summary>How do we prepare before the event?</summary><p>We talk through your plans, venue, schedule and family priorities. Share important entrances, speeches and traditions so we can plan around them.</p></details><details><summary>What coverage and final films or photos are included?</summary><p>Coverage is discussed around your celebration. Your proposal will set out the agreed coverage and final photo and film work; contact us to talk through the options.</p></details><details><summary>What does Sweet Sixteen coverage cost?</summary><p>Tell us the date, location and what you have planned. We’ll discuss the coverage and prepare a proposal for your celebration.</p></details><details><summary>How do we start?</summary><p><a href=\"/contact-us-2/?occasion=sweet-sixteen\">Send an inquiry</a> with your event date and plans, or <a href=\"https://clients.giolina.co/schedule/61f5ca5de95956002dd1c3d7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">schedule a conversation</a>.</p></details></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-sweet-presentation\" aria-labelledby=\"sweet-presentation-title\"><div class=\"gl-landing-wrap\"><figure><img src=\"/assets/sweet-julia-presentation.webp\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Julia in her red Sweet Sixteen gown beside a window\" style=\"object-position:50% 35%\"></figure><div class=\"gl-sweet-presentation-copy\"><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">The complete experience</p><h2 id=\"sweet-presentation-title\">Sweet Sixteen Presentation</h2><a class=\"gl-sweet-presentation-cta\" href=\"https://mediazilla.com/62aYiGyhwV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View Presentation</a></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-landing-inquiry\"><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">Make it yours</p><h2>Let’s talk about your Sweet Sixteen.</h2><a class=\"gl-landing-button\" href=\"/contact-us-2/?occasion=sweet-sixteen\">Inquire about your celebration</a><p>Prefer to speak directly? <a href=\"mailto:info@giolina.co\">info@giolina.co</a> · <a href=\"tel:8663060308\">866-306-0308</a></p></section>\n</article>\n<script src=\"/image-rotation.js\" defer></script>\n<script type=\"module\" src=\"/mediazilla-player.js\"></script>",
